                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="mother of a family, having grown-up daughters or some other women under"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l7" HPOS="337" VPOS="806" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="339 850 2112 845" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="339 850 339 862 2110 860 2112 845 2108 817 2022 806 2020 806 2019 806 1989 817 1868 817 1853 806 1851 806 1849 806 1847 806 1845 806 1814 815 1736 806 1734 806 1586 815 1553 806 1551 806 1549 806 1483 817 1307 808 1305 808 1303 808 1272 817 1239 808 1237 808 1235 808 1155 817 888 809 886 809 884 809 882 809 869 819 834 809 832 809 830 809 828 809 787 819 705 809 703 809 701 809 668 819 337 813 339 850"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="her rule, goes into the inner room with the men and eats with them. As a"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l8" HPOS="339" VPOS="868" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="55" BASELINE="340 909 2114 903" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="340 909 340 923 2112 921 2114 903 2108 868 1054 878 968 868 966 868 964 868 962 868 947 878 791 870 789 870 787 870 785 870 767 880 485 870 483 870 434 880 385 870 383 870 381 870 339 882 340 909"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="rule, the women, though they stay more at home than the men, still spend"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l9" HPOS="339" VPOS="932" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="49" BASELINE="339 967 2114 967" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="339 967 339 981 2114 981 2114 967 2114 938 339 932 339 967"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="less time under shelter of the sleeping-room. A young woman is the first to"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l10" HPOS="337" VPOS="985" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="339 1030 2112 1026" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="339 1030 339 1041 2108 1047 2112 1026 2108 997 2030 985 2028 985 2026 985 1989 995 1855 985 1853 985 1851 985 1818 995 1773 985 1771 985 1769 985 1740 995 1672 985 1670 985 1578 997 1334 997 1317 985 1315 985 1313 985 1311 985 1266 995 1227 985 1225 985 1223 985 1221 985 1196 997 1177 987 1175 987 1173 987 1120 997 1007 987 1005 987 943 999 828 999 812 987 810 987 808 987 806 987 804 987 773 997 722 987 721 987 719 987 683 997 648 987 646 987 645 987 337 993 339 1030"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="leave it early in the morning, and the last to enter it late in the evening;"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l11" HPOS="337" VPOS="1047" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="339 1090 2112 1082" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="339 1090 339 1104 2110 1098 2112 1082 2108 1055 1260 1047 1258 1047 1256 1047 1219 1057 401 1051 399 1051 337 1061 339 1090"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="and when a guest comes to pass a night, and the room proves to be too"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l12" HPOS="339" VPOS="1110" WIDTH="1777" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="340 1149 2116 1143" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="340 1149 340 1162 1516 1170 1518 1170 1588 1158 1732 1168 1734 1168 2114 1156 2116 1143 2112 1115 424 1110 422 1110 339 1119 340 1149"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="small, the woman has to go out and perhaps pass the night in the outer"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l13" HPOS="337" VPOS="1164" WIDTH="1779" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="339 1209 2116 1203" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="339 1209 339 1223 2114 1217 2116 1203 2112 1176 1820 1164 1818 1164 1816 1164 1814 1164 1798 1176 1576 1176 1541 1164 1539 1164 1537 1164 1535 1164 1486 1176 952 1166 951 1166 845 1178 526 1168 524 1168 440 1178 426 1168 424 1168 422 1168 420 1168 337 1180 339 1209"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="tent, unless she is needed by the males for special reasons. On the other"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l14" HPOS="339" VPOS="1229" WIDTH="1777" HEIGHT="54" BASELINE="340 1267 2116 1264" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="340 1267 340 1283 2114 1283 2116 1264 2112 1229 364 1229 362 1229 360 1229 339 1236 340 1267"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="side the woman also performs much of the man’s work. Young women and"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l15" HPOS="339" VPOS="1285" WIDTH="1418" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="340 1328 1757 1324" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="340 1328 340 1347 1755 1345 1757 1324 1753 1297 1541 1297 1508 1285 1506 1285 1504 1285 1502 1285 1500 1285 1488 1297 1368 1297 1336 1285 1334 1285 1332 1285 1227 1295 1149 1285 1147 1285 1089 1295 1050 1285 1048 1285 1046 1285 1044 1285 1042 1285 1042 1287 1030 1297 970 1287 968 1287 654 1297 592 1287 590 1287 588 1287 555 1297 463 1287 461 1287 459 1287 457 1287 442 1297 374 1287 372 1287 370 1287 339 1299 340 1328"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="girls help the men in herding in winter and even in summer."/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l16" HPOS="455" VPOS="1347" WIDTH="1659" HEIGHT="53" BASELINE="455 1384 2114 1384" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="455 1384 455 1400 2114 1400 2114 1384 2114 1357 455 1347 455 1384"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="When a reindeer herdsman comes home after twenty-four hours spent in"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l17" HPOS="337" VPOS="1406" WIDTH="1779" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="339 1449 2116 1443" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="339 1449 339 1462 2114 1458 2116 1443 2112 1414 1023 1406 1021 1406 337 1418 339 1449"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="running around the restive animals, he is given a change of dry clothes, takes"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l18" HPOS="339" VPOS="1464" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="67" BASELINE="340 1507 2114 1501" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="340 1507 340 1521 452 1531 454 1531 455 1531 457 1531 475 1521 586 1521 633 1531 635 1531 810 1521 917 1531 919 1531 921 1531 923 1531 945 1519 1227 1529 1229 1529 1231 1529 1264 1519 1364 1529 1366 1529 1440 1519 2110 1519 2114 1501 2110 1474 1592 1464 1590 1464 1485 1474 1009 1466 1007 1466 927 1478 339 1478 340 1507"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="food, and goes to sleep. A woman, though returning with him from the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l19" HPOS="339" VPOS="1533" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="48" BASELINE="340 1568 2112 1564" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="340 1568 340 1581 2110 1579 2112 1564 2108 1534 339 1533 340 1568"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="herd, has to prepare the food, and then take part in the household cares."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l20" HPOS="344" VPOS="1583" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="346 1626 2114 1622" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="346 1626 346 1642 2112 1642 2114 1622 2106 1583 2071 1593 1978 1583 1820 1583 1818 1583 1816 1583 1814 1583 1800 1593 1746 1583 1744 1583 1742 1583 1714 1593 1551 1583 1549 1583 1225 1595 344 1589 346 1626"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="When I was passing a summer among the Chukchee on the Oloi River, I"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l21" HPOS="340" VPOS="1644" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="342 1685 2114 1681" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="342 1685 342 1698 2110 1700 2114 1681 2110 1655 2020 1644 2019 1644 2017 1644 1987 1653 1923 1644 1921 1644 1919 1644 1890 1655 1677 1655 1644 1644 1642 1644 1640 1644 1592 1653 1578 1644 1576 1644 1574 1644 1397 1644 1395 1644 1393 1644 1371 1655 1225 1655 1167 1646 1165 1646 1163 1646 1126 1655 1089 1646 1087 1646 1085 1646 1083 1646 1050 1655 845 1646 843 1646 785 1655 734 1646 732 1646 553 1655 407 1646 405 1646 340 1657 342 1685"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="staid for a couple of months in the camp of Eiˊheli, whose name has been"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l22" HPOS="339" VPOS="1700" WIDTH="1777" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="340 1747 2116 1741" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="340 1747 340 1761 2114 1755 2116 1741 2112 1714 2052 1700 2050 1700 2048 1700 2015 1712 1985 1700 1983 1700 1981 1700 1980 1700 1978 1700 1958 1712 1900 1700 1898 1700 1896 1700 1894 1700 1874 1712 1831 1700 1829 1700 1828 1700 1826 1700 1798 1712 1699 1700 1697 1700 1695 1700 1664 1712 1477 1702 1475 1702 1473 1702 1446 1714 1136 1702 1134 1702 1132 1702 1130 1702 1110 1714 1048 1702 1046 1702 1044 1702 1011 1714 933 1702 931 1702 929 1702 900 1716 857 1704 855 1704 853 1704 734 1716 672 1704 670 1704 494 1714 457 1704 455 1704 454 1704 339 1718 340 1747"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="mentioned before. His elder daughter-in-law would come from the herd after"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l23" HPOS="339" VPOS="1761" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="340 1809 2114 1800" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="340 1809 340 1821 2112 1817 2114 1800 2112 1772 2069 1761 2067 1761 2065 1761 2063 1761 2038 1770 1997 1761 1995 1761 1993 1761 1892 1770 1818 1761 1816 1761 1753 1772 1428 1763 1426 1763 988 1776 695 1766 693 1766 691 1766 662 1778 641 1768 639 1768 637 1768 494 1778 416 1768 415 1768 339 1780 340 1809"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="a two days’ absence. In summer the Chukchee herdsmen, while with the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l24" HPOS="339" VPOS="1821" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="340 1866 2112 1862" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="340 1866 340 1881 2110 1881 2112 1862 2108 1835 2011 1835 1991 1821 1989 1821 1987 1821 1985 1821 1983 1821 1956 1833 1900 1821 1898 1821 1896 1821 1845 1833 1713 1821 1711 1821 1709 1821 1662 1835 1598 1835 1576 1821 1574 1821 1572 1821 1570 1821 1568 1821 1535 1833 1500 1821 1498 1821 1434 1821 1432 1821 1430 1821 1428 1821 1410 1833 1362 1821 1360 1821 1358 1821 1297 1833 1167 1823 1165 1823 1163 1823 1161 1823 1143 1837 1052 1837 1032 1823 1030 1823 1028 1823 1027 1823 1025 1823 988 1835 830 1823 828 1823 826 1823 789 1835 773 1823 771 1823 769 1823 689 1823 687 1823 685 1823 683 1823 666 1835 563 1823 561 1823 559 1823 530 1835 391 1823 389 1823 387 1823 339 1837 340 1866"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="reindeer, have little time to sleep. They take their sleep when coming home."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l25" HPOS="340" VPOS="1881" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="342 1926 2116 1920" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="342 1926 342 1940 2114 1940 2116 1920 2114 1893 2091 1881 2089 1881 2087 1881 2085 1881 2057 1891 2028 1881 2026 1881 2024 1881 1892 1891 1851 1881 1849 1881 1847 1881 1845 1881 1843 1881 1829 1891 1738 1881 1736 1881 1734 1881 1732 1881 1716 1893 1625 1893 1586 1881 1584 1881 1582 1881 1518 1895 1327 1895 1309 1883 1307 1883 1305 1883 1303 1883 1301 1883 1272 1893 1202 1883 1200 1883 1141 1893 340 1893 342 1926"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Still the young woman was not allowed to go to sleep. Eiˊheli would sit"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l26" HPOS="340" VPOS="1946" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="52" BASELINE="342 1985 2114 1981" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="342 1985 342 1998 2112 1996 2114 1981 2110 1953 360 1946 358 1946 356 1946 354 1946 340 1952 342 1985"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="down in the inner room and order her to prepare tea and food. The woman"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l27" HPOS="340" VPOS="2000" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="342 2043 2114 2039" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="342 2043 342 2059 2112 2057 2114 2039 2112 2012 2069 2000 2067 2000 2065 2000 2063 2000 2038 2010 1941 2000 1939 2000 1937 2000 1909 2010 1888 2000 1886 2000 1884 2000 1831 2010 1808 2000 1806 2000 1804 2000 1713 2010 1656 2000 1654 2000 1533 2010 1477 2000 1475 2000 1473 2000 1471 2000 1455 2012 1225 2012 1182 2002 1180 2002 1179 2002 1177 2002 1149 2012 687 2002 685 2002 637 2012 559 2002 557 2002 555 2002 533 2014 340 2014 342 2043"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="was wearied. She looked like one in a trance. She would mechanically take"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l28" HPOS="339" VPOS="2063" WIDTH="1777" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="340 2106 2116 2102" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="340 2106 340 2119 2114 2117 2116 2102 2114 2072 2096 2063 2095 2063 2093 2063 2091 2063 2089 2063 2057 2072 1886 2063 1884 2063 1755 2072 1724 2063 1722 2063 1720 2063 1718 2063 1716 2063 1701 2074 1566 2074 1512 2063 1510 2063 1508 2063 1469 2072 1387 2063 1385 2063 1383 2063 1381 2063 1366 2074 1272 2074 1229 2063 1227 2063 1225 2063 1223 2063 1200 2074 1130 2065 1128 2065 797 2074 754 2065 752 2065 750 2065 748 2065 717 2074 633 2065 631 2065 629 2065 627 2065 611 2076 420 2076 364 2065 362 2065 360 2065 339 2074 340 2106"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the teapot, but, instead of pouring the tea into the cup, she would pour it"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l29" HPOS="339" VPOS="2125" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="340 2166 2114 2162" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="340 2166 340 2180 2110 2183 2114 2162 2110 2133 364 2125 362 2125 360 2125 339 2133 340 2166"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="right on the eating-table. In another camp I saw another woman of nineteen,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l30" HPOS="342" VPOS="2180" WIDTH="1772" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="344 2224 2114 2219" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="344 2224 344 2240 2112 2240 2114 2219 2112 2191 2081 2180 2079 2180 2077 2180 2075 2180 2050 2189 1981 2180 1980 2180 1978 2180 1976 2180 1960 2191 1828 2191 1800 2180 1798 2180 1796 2180 1794 2180 1792 2180 1779 2189 1701 2180 1699 2180 1697 2180 1695 2180 1679 2191 1568 2191 1541 2180 1539 2180 1537 2180 1535 2180 1533 2180 1518 2191 1436 2182 1434 2182 1432 2182 1405 2191 1297 2182 1295 2182 1294 2182 1268 2193 1079 2193 976 2182 974 2182 972 2182 931 2193 908 2183 906 2183 904 2183 639 2193 584 2183 582 2183 580 2183 559 2195 438 2195 383 2183 381 2183 379 2183 342 2195 344 2224"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="who was the second wife of the master of the front house, fall down suddenly"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-014_l31" HPOS="340" VPOS="2242" WIDTH="1772" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="340 2283 2112 2283" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="340 2283 340 2295 2110 2302 2112 2283 2112 2252 2071 2242 2069 2242 2067 2242 2065 2242 2036 2254 1927 2254 1911 2242 1909 2242 1907 2242 1905 2242 1904 2242 1872 2254 1660 2254 1627 2242 1625 2242 1623 2242 1566 2252 1477 2242 1475 2242 1375 2252 1276 2242 1274 2242 1272 2242 1247 2252 1223 2242 1221 2242 1219 2242 1218 2242 1190 2252 1089 2242 1087 2242 1038 2252 945 2242 943 2242 941 2242 910 2252 771 2242 769 2242 697 2252 641 2242 639 2242 340 2250 340 2283"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="in the middle of her work as if struck by a bullet. She was struck, not by"/>
                    </TextLine>

